+# TASK-260720-3c0ss2 — installed-context currentness rework
+
+## Provenance and scope
+
+- CocoaSkills repository: `/Users/iv/Developer/Wildberries/cocoaskills`
+- Clean, fetched `main`, task `HEAD`, and `origin/main`:
